{"id":"e18t3","name":"Monthly Growth with Empty Months","lang":"sql","entry":null,"params":[],"limit_s":10,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>The table <b>orders</b> has the columns <code>order_id</code>, <code>region</code>, <code>ordered_at</code> (timestamp) and <code>amount</code> (numeric).</p>\n<p>Finance wants, for each region, one row for <b>every</b> month from the first month with an order in this region to the last month with an order in this region, including months without orders (revenue <code>0</code>).</p>\n<p>Your task is to return the columns <code>region</code>, <code>month</code> (date of the first day of the month), <code>revenue</code> (sum of <code>amount</code>, rounded to 2 decimals) and <code>growth_pct</code>: the change from the previous month of the same region in percent, rounded to 1 decimal, <code>NULL</code> for the first month and when the previous month revenue is <code>0</code>. Sort by <code>region</code>, then <code>month</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>Table <code>orders</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>order_id</th><th>region</th><th>ordered_at</th><th>amount</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>north</td><td>2026-01-15 10:00:00</td><td>100.0</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>north</td><td>2026-01-20 10:00:00</td><td>50.0</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>north</td><td>2026-02-02 10:00:00</td><td>120.0</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>north</td><td>2026-04-30 23:00:00</td><td>60.0</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>south</td><td>2026-02-10 09:00:00</td><td>80.0</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>south</td><td>2026-03-01 00:00:00</td><td>0.0</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>south</td><td>2026-04-11 12:00:00</td><td>40.0</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>region</th><th>month</th><th>revenue</th><th>growth_pct</th></tr><tr><td>north</td><td>2026-01-01</td><td>150.0</td><td>null</td></tr><tr><td>north</td><td>2026-02-01</td><td>120.0</td><td>-20.0</td></tr><tr><td>north</td><td>2026-03-01</td><td>0.0</td><td>-100.0</td></tr><tr><td>north</td><td>2026-04-01</td><td>60.0</td><td>null</td></tr><tr><td>south</td><td>2026-02-01</td><td>80.0</td><td>null</td></tr><tr><td>south</td><td>2026-03-01</td><td>0.0</td><td>-100.0</td></tr><tr><td>south</td><td>2026-04-01</td><td>40.0</td><td>null</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 10 seconds (psql)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB</div>","starter":"/* Write your PostgreSQL query here */\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["generate_series","mois sans vente","LAG","division par zéro"],"minutes":15,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"tables":{"orders":{"columns":[["order_id","INT"],["region","TEXT"],["ordered_at","TIMESTAMP"],["amount","NUMERIC(10,2)"]],"rows":[[1,"north","2026-01-15 10:00:00",100.0],[2,"north","2026-01-20 10:00:00",50.0],[3,"north","2026-02-02 10:00:00",120.0],[4,"north","2026-04-30 23:00:00",60.0],[5,"south","2026-02-10 09:00:00",80.0],[6,"south","2026-03-01 00:00:00",0.0],[7,"south","2026-04-11 12:00:00",40.0]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["region","month","revenue","growth_pct"],"rows":[["north","2026-01-01",150.0,null],["north","2026-02-01",120.0,-20.0],["north","2026-03-01",0.0,-100.0],["north","2026-04-01",60.0,null],["south","2026-02-01",80.0,null],["south","2026-03-01",0.0,-100.0],["south","2026-04-01",40.0,null]]}},{"input":{"tables":{"orders":{"columns":[["order_id","INT"],["region","TEXT"],["ordered_at","TIMESTAMP"],["amount","NUMERIC(10,2)"]],"rows":[[1,"x","2025-12-31 23:59:00",10.0],[2,"x","2026-01-01 00:00:00",13.33]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["region","month","revenue","growth_pct"],"rows":[["x","2025-12-01",10.0,null],["x","2026-01-01",13.33,33.3]]}}],"hidden_n":7,"hidden":"","solution":""}